OL,3,GNEWSAPedestrian injured in motorbike
OL,4,Ahit-and-run
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pedestrian was left seriously injured
OL,7,Fafter being hit by a motorbike whose
OL,8,Frider had not stopped for police
OL,9,Fofficers when requested to do so.
OL,11,FWest Yorkshire Police said the biker
OL,12,Fhad failed to stop on Thornton Road in
OL,13,FBradford just after 15:30 BST on
OL,14,FWednesday, before officers pursued the
OL,15,Fvehicle for a short time.
OL,17,FThe motorbike was then involved in a
OL,18,Fcollision with a pedestrian on Legrams
OL,19,FLane two minutes later, with the
OL,20,Fpedestrian needing to be taken to
OL,21,Fhospital with serious injuries.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
